@startuml sequence_get
actor "Opérateur" as User
participant "DashboardComponent" as Dashboard
participant "AnomalyService" as AngularSvc
participant "DroppyAnomalyController" as Controller
participant "DroppyAnomalyRepository" as Repo
database "H2 / PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Dashboard : Appliquer filtres
Dashboard -> AngularSvc : getAnomalies({mac, status, severity})
AngularSvc -> Controller : GET /api/v1/droppy/anomalies?...

Controller -> Repo : filterAnomalies(...)
Repo -> DB : JPQL Query + Pagination
DB --> Repo : Page<DroppyAnomaly>
Repo --> Controller : Page result
Controller --> AngularSvc : JSON
AngularSvc --> Dashboard : PageResponse
Dashboard --> User : Affichage tableau + stats
@enduml
